  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Bleeding Hand)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you would be targeted by an attack roll, you may discard a card from your hand to gain a +2 luck bonus to your AC against the attack roll. If you possess the Handblood’s Advantage feat, you may discard a card when you are forced to make a saving throw to gain a +2 bonus to the saving throw based on the type of card discarded.</p>\n<p><em>Physical:</em> Fortitude saving throw<br>\n<em>Mental:</em> Reflex saving throw<br>\n<em>Spiritual:</em> Will saving throw</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat a second time, in which case you may discard a second card to increase the AC or saving throw bonus from +2 to +4.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
